# The default apps a standard bande-desktop install gets: every Bande app built in
# bande-linux/apps, released on its own. An app is added here when it gets its first APT release.
# bande-desktop recommends them unversioned, so a user can remove or replace any of them.
# Packages built in the desktop repo are part of the desktop and are not listed here.
# One package per line. Read by debian/default-apps.sh, ci/release/build-all.sh and
# ci/deb/install-test/run.sh.

bande-terminal
bande-software
bande-installer
bande-archive
bande-monitor
bande-calculator
bande-preview
bande-clock
bande-disks
bande-textedit
bande-mail
bande-calendar
